<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja-JP"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="437292725"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6766858897"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Open your eyes"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="亜咲花"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Open your eyes (TVアニメ「Occultic;Nine -オカルティック・ナイン-」EDテーマ)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:31.725"><div begin="00:07.042" end="04:12.046"><p begin="00:07.042" end="00:08.827" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35468">冷たい (Another star)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无视冰冷的泪水</span></p><p begin="00:08.898" end="00:10.743" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35469">涙も (Another sky)</p><p begin="00:10.778" end="00:12.603" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35470">震える (Another world)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与颤抖的心跳</span></p><p begin="00:12.632" end="00:14.399" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35471">この鼓動さえも</p><p begin="00:14.475" end="00:16.327" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35472">Open your eyes (Another star)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">睁开双眼 彼此凝视</span></p><p begin="00:16.327" end="00:18.089" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35473">見つめ合う (Another sky)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相互凝视的双眸</span></p><p begin="00:18.159" end="00:19.984" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35474">瞳は (Another world)</p><p begin="00:19.995" end="00:23.103" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35475">醒めない夢になって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">形成令人如痴如醉的梦</span></p><p begin="00:37.602" end="00:41.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35476">感じるままに 空の色は様々で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依循自己的感觉</span></p><p begin="00:41.238" end="00:44.839" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35477">見る人ごとに 違う青に染まった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">同时却因人而异</span></p><p begin="00:44.933" end="00:48.635" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35478">理想の数と 言い訳の数を合わせ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">理想的数量</span></p><p begin="00:48.656" end="00:49.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35479">守ってばかり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是一味地守护与受伤</span></p><p begin="00:49.868" end="00:52.109" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35480">傷つくなんてナンセンス<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本毫无意义</span></p><p begin="00:52.122" end="00:53.657" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35481">Life is not fair<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人生本不公平 但我愿随之走下去</span></p><p begin="00:53.730" end="00:55.428" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35482">But I will follow it</p><p begin="00:55.832" end="00:59.457" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35483">穢れるほどに格好つけて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">故作坚强直到堕落为止</span></p><p begin="00:59.491" end="01:01.059" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35484">What can you do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你可以做些什么来守护世界和平</span></p><p begin="01:01.092" end="01:02.916" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35485">To promote world peace?</p><p begin="01:03.206" end="01:07.968" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35486">スローモーションに 時を刻んだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时间正以慢动作</span></p><p begin="01:08.087" end="01:09.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35487">冷たい (Another star)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无视冰冷的</span></p><p begin="01:09.825" end="01:11.597" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35488">涙も (Another sky)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泪水</span></p><p begin="01:11.696" end="01:13.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35489">震える (Another world)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与颤抖的</span></p><p begin="01:13.523" end="01:15.284" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35490">この鼓動さえも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心跳</span></p><p begin="01:15.371" end="01:17.143" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35491">Open your eyes (Another star)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">睁开双眼（另一颗星） 彼此凝视（另一片天空）</span></p><p begin="01:17.213" end="01:18.997" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35492">見つめ合う (Another sky)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相互凝视的</span></p><p begin="01:19.041" end="01:20.832" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35493">瞳は (Another world)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">双眸</span></p><p begin="01:20.923" end="01:23.747" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35494">醒めない夢になって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">形成令人如痴如醉的梦</span></p><p begin="01:23.969" end="01:30.109" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35495">微弱なる五感が僕らの存在<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">稍有不同的五种感官是我们存在的证明</span></p><p begin="01:30.140" end="01:32.008" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35496">近くて (Another star)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">近在眼前却远如天边</span></p><p begin="01:32.055" end="01:33.731" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35497">遠すぎる (Another sky)</p><p begin="01:33.827" end="01:35.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35498">この場所 (Another world)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而身在此处</span></p><p begin="01:35.669" end="01:38.146" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35499">終わりがまた始まるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一旦结束又将迎来新的开始</span></p><p begin="01:38.241" end="01:40.726" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35500">One Two Three Four Five<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">1、2、3、4、5、6、7、8、9</span></p><p begin="01:40.763" end="01:42.527" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35501">Six Seven Eight Nine</p><p begin="01:56.971" end="02:00.635" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35502">夢の続きは 遠すぎる未来だから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦想的延续</span></p><p begin="02:00.639" end="02:04.232" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35503">気持ち乱れて 自分を誤魔化した<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紊乱的思绪</span></p><p begin="02:04.359" end="02:07.981" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35504">言い訳の数 被害者意識を盾に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是以受害者的立场</span></p><p begin="02:08.013" end="02:11.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35505">諦めるほど 迷宮入りのマイセルフ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">困于迷宫的自我</span></p><p begin="02:11.489" end="02:13.066" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35506">Life is not fair<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人生本不公平 但我愿随之走下去</span></p><p begin="02:13.122" end="02:14.979" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35507">But I will follow it</p><p begin="02:15.149" end="02:18.727" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35508">大切なシグナル見落とした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">未能察觉到关键的信号</span></p><p begin="02:18.877" end="02:20.455" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35509">What can you do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你可以做些什么来守护世界和平</span></p><p begin="02:20.461" end="02:22.426" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35510">To promote world peace?</p><p begin="02:22.560" end="02:27.401" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35511">神はまた僕に嘘をついた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">上帝再次对我撒了个谎</span></p><p begin="02:27.469" end="02:29.142" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35512">眩しい (Another star)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无畏刺眼的</span></p><p begin="02:29.207" end="02:31.014" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35513">太陽 (Another sky)</p><p begin="02:31.067" end="02:32.949" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35514">冷たい (Another world)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或寒风的</span></p><p begin="02:32.973" end="02:34.741" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35515">風のささやきも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呢喃</span></p><p begin="02:34.798" end="02:36.556" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35516">Open your eyes (Another star)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">睁开你的双眼（另一颗星）想传达的（另一片天空）</span></p><p begin="02:36.585" end="02:38.433" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35517">伝えたい (Another sky)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渴望传达的</span></p><p begin="02:38.466" end="02:40.221" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35518">想いは (Another world)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心情</span></p><p begin="02:40.314" end="02:42.983" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35519">指の隙間に堕ちて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却在指缝间逐步凋零</span></p><p begin="02:43.308" end="02:46.939" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35520">目に見えないフェイクで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是难以亲眼目睹的假象</span></p><p begin="02:47.022" end="02:49.504" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35521">僕らを裏切る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">背叛了我们</span></p><p begin="02:49.530" end="02:51.365" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35522">二人が (Another star)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两个人伸出双手</span></p><p begin="02:51.413" end="02:53.178" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35523">手を伸ばし (Another sky)</p><p begin="02:53.211" end="02:54.987" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35524">抱きしめ (Another world)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧紧地拥抱</span></p><p begin="02:55.057" end="02:57.591" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35525">命の意味に触れたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿能因此寻获生命的意义</span></p><p begin="02:57.605" end="02:59.956" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35526">One Two Three Four Five<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">1、2、3、4、5、6、7、8、9</span></p><p begin="03:00.198" end="03:02.012" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35527">Six Seven Eight Nine</p><p begin="03:22.775" end="03:24.538" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35528">全ての (Another star)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一切的</span></p><p begin="03:24.600" end="03:26.479" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35529">始まり (Another sky)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开端</span></p><p begin="03:26.500" end="03:28.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35530">世界は (Another world)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将世界</span></p><p begin="03:28.311" end="03:30.172" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35531">闇へ朽ちて行く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">推向腐朽的黑暗</span></p><p begin="03:30.233" end="03:32.059" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35532">Open your eyes (Another star)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">睁开你的双眼（另一颗星） 就算生命（另一片天空）</span></p><p begin="03:32.198" end="03:33.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35533">命さえ (Another sky)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将生命</span></p><p begin="03:33.849" end="03:35.704" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35534">無価値と (Another world)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">视为无价值的玩物</span></p><p begin="03:35.787" end="03:37.436" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35535">仮面が笑う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假面正在窃笑着</span></p><p begin="03:37.492" end="03:39.374" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35536">冷たい (Another star)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无视冰冷的</span></p><p begin="03:39.412" end="03:41.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35537">涙も (Another sky)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泪水</span></p><p begin="03:41.505" end="03:43.132" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35538">震える (Another world)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与颤抖的</span></p><p begin="03:43.208" end="03:44.946" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35539">この鼓動さえも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心跳</span></p><p begin="03:44.967" end="03:46.782" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35540">Open your eyes (Another star)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">睁开双眼（另一颗星） 彼此凝视（另一片天空）</span></p><p begin="03:46.845" end="03:48.561" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35541">見つめ合う (Another sky)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相互凝视的</span></p><p begin="03:48.648" end="03:50.434" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35542">瞳は (Another world)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">双眸</span></p><p begin="03:50.604" end="03:53.147" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35543">醒めない夢になって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">形成令人如痴如醉的梦</span></p><p begin="03:53.727" end="03:59.709" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35544">微弱なる五感が僕らの存在<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">稍有不同的五种感官是我们存在的证明</span></p><p begin="03:59.733" end="04:01.654" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35545">近くて (Another star)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">近在眼前却远如天边然而身在此处</span></p><p begin="04:01.694" end="04:03.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35546">遠すぎる (Another sky)</p><p begin="04:03.355" end="04:05.283" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35547">この場所 (Another world)</p><p begin="04:05.326" end="04:07.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35548">終わりがまた始まるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一旦结束又将迎来新的开始</span></p><p begin="04:07.825" end="04:10.253" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35549">One Two Three Four Five<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">1、2、3、4、5、6、7、8、9</span></p><p begin="04:10.344" end="04:12.046" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35550">Six Seven Eight Nine</p></div></body></tt>